Two versions here, one John playing solo from 2018, and a duet with Bonnie Raitt.  The intro and instrumental bridges are a little different, and Bonnie reverses "thunder" and "lightning" in the first verse.  Bonnie also plays a (C) instead of an (A) in the last line of the verse.  <Rake> means to strum once slowly downward from the 6th string to the 1st string.
  
  
